# The dental workbench this simulation was lifted from: one 68 MB HTML file,
# almost all of it a base64 3D model and a thousand pre-rendered tooth images.
# What was worth keeping is already in the tree — the model itself lives at
# src/assets/dental/jaw.glb at 1.2 MB. The original is kept out of git because a
# file this size is permanent once committed, and nothing builds from it.
